  "name": "Pickled Jalapeños and Carrots",
  "subtitle": "Tangy refrigerator vegetables with a crisp bite",
  "description": "Jalapeños, carrots, and red onion are briefly heated with sweetened vinegar, then chilled for a bright, crunchy side.",
